<title>USA: ABC Rail completes American Systems buy.</title>
<headline>ABC Rail completes American Systems buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABC Rail Products Corp said Wednesday it completed the acquisition of American Systems Technologies Inc, a private Verona, Wis.-based company involved in railway signal system installations and maintenance.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>ABC Rail manufactures and markets replacement products and original equipment for the freight railroad and rail transit industries.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
